# Sample Data rasters larger than 50 MB (GitHub's own warning threshold).
# These 33 files are 2.58 GB of the plugin's 2.93 GB, and near-identical copies
# are already tracked under MLPREP_Plugin_v4_3/. Everything else in Sample Data
# -- the .tfw world files, the .aux.xml statistics and the .xml ArcGIS lineage
# that documents how each predictor was built -- is small and stays tracked.
